  "experiment_statement": "In E12 (small, low-density, bursty Alibaba-derived jobs), thermal_predictive had the lowest and packing the highest time-mean max-rack coolant temperature in all three seeds (PB−TP 0.08–0.18 °C; packing−TP 0.35–0.44 °C). This is below the preregistered 0.5 °C materiality threshold, rests on about two independent workload conditions (seed 3 ≈ seed 2 shifted 33 s), and is descriptive only.",
  "reproducibility_scope": "Fresh-process reproducibility was verified for E10 packing seed 1 (2 h), for E11 seed-1 packing and power_balance over the first 2 h (exact prefix), and for E12 thermal_predictive seed 1 (6 h, byte-identical). No other configuration was directly repeated; no cross-machine portability is claimed."
